- P1 — The distributable contract was changed but remains labeled v2.6. The release declares contract v2.9 at [CLAUDE.md:3](/Users/[REDACTED:user]/code/coverloop/CLAUDE.md:3), while the template header and session instruction still say v2.6 at [docs/OPERATING_CONTRACT.md:1](/Users/[REDACTED:user]/code/coverloop/docs/OPERATING_CONTRACT.md:1) and [docs/OPERATING_CONTRACT.md:13](/Users/[REDACTED:user]/code/coverloop/docs/OPERATING_CONTRACT.md:13). `init-project.sh` copies that stale-version template into projects at [init-project.sh:57](/Users/[REDACTED:user]/code/coverloop/init-project.sh:57). Section 13 is also stale, claiming the header is v2.8 and the template deliberately v2.6 at [CLAUDE.md:428](/Users/[REDACTED:user]/code/coverloop/CLAUDE.md:428). This defeats the intended contract-resync signal.

